      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bohan Hyland & Associates are thrilled to present a rare opportunity to acquire a turnkey detached home in the highly sought after “Saggart Lakes” development. This five-bedroom, six-bathroom property comes to market in amazing condition and really needs to be seen to be appreciated.\r\n\r\nThis property will appeal to a buyer looking for their forever home in the Saggart area. Saggart Lakes is a well-established, gated development in a much sought after and convenient location. It is within a stone's throw of Saggart Village and close to a variety of primary and secondary schools. Saggart Lakes is within close proximity to multiple golf clubs, an abundance of cafes/restaurants, gyms and a handful of Shopping Centres. The LUAS Red Line Saggart stop is on the doorstep which provides an excellent connection into the city centre and beyond. The development is low density set behind electric gates providing an additional layer of security.\r\n\r\nThis property briefly comprises of extensive accommodation which makes excellent use of the well-proportioned reception rooms and is well balanced with large bedrooms. This home extends to over approx. 373m2 of spacious living accommodation, and includes a large entrance hall, generous living room, dining room, home office, large kitchen with WC and access to the garage laid out as a gym on the ground floor. 5 Saggart Lakes offers four bedrooms on the first floor with a large master bedroom with walk-in wardrobe, balcony and ensuite bathroom. The third floor provides another master suite with additional storage and large ensuite bathroom. Many additional benefits include a large, private garden and a gated driveway providing parking for multiple vehicles.\r\n\r\n2026 Service Charge: c. €2500.\r\n\r\nTo view this property, call Shane Hanevy today on 01 491 3000."
      },
